{"id":"fa7a47e0464f94a4","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-truth-theory-development.md","title":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的发展","display":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的发展","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-truth-theory-development","aliases":["91-fact-truth-theory-development","91-fact-theory-history","91-fact-truth-theory-evolution"],"display":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的发展","depends_on":["[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-VF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-truth-theory-development"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-truth-theory-development</span><span>91-fact-theory-history</span><span>91-fact-truth-theory-evolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的发展"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Earlier}(a,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{Earlier}(a,b)\\)</span> (方案 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 在历史上早于方案 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Method}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{Method}(a)\\)</span> (方案 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的核心机制)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{VF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{VF}\\)</span> (四类方案)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hierarchy},\\mathsf{SKFix},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\">\\(\\mathsf{Hierarchy},\\mathsf{SKFix},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\\)</span> (机制标签)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}development}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Earlier}(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{Tarski})=\\mathsf{Hierarchy}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{Kripke})=\\mathsf{SKFix}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}development}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Earlier}(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{Tarski})=\\mathsf{Hierarchy}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{Kripke})=\\mathsf{SKFix}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\land\\\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{FS})=\\mathsf{CaptureRelease}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{VF})=\\mathsf{Supervaluation}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\land\\\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{FS})=\\mathsf{CaptureRelease}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{VF})=\\mathsf{Supervaluation}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>发展的关键不是一条单调增强的强度链，而是处理自指的机制分化：\nTarski 以对象语言/元语言层级阻断自指；Kripke 用强 Kleene 跳跃及其\n固定点解释部分真理；Friedman–Sheard 以组合公理配合 capture/release\n规则；Cantini 的 VF 则公理化超赋值式真理。</p>\n<p>这些方案后来分别接受模型论、反思论与序数分析。历史先后不能替代\n证明论比较：例如标准 FS 的算术强度低于 KF，而 VF 又严格强于 KF，\n所以原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}&lt;\\mathrm{UTB}&lt;\\mathrm{CT}&lt;\\mathrm{KF}&lt;\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}&lt;\\mathrm{UTB}&lt;\\mathrm{CT}&lt;\\mathrm{KF}&lt;\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span>\n不是正确的发展或强度图。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Earlier}(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Method}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Hierarchy},\\mathsf{SKFix},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}development}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Earlier}(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{Tarski})=\\mathsf{Hierarchy}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{Kripke})=\\mathsf{SKFix}","display":true},{"tex":"\\land\\\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{FS})=\\mathsf{CaptureRelease}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Method}(\\mathsf{VF})=\\mathsf{Supervaluation}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}<\\mathrm{UTB}<\\mathrm{CT}<\\mathrm{KF}<\\mathrm{FS}","display":false}],"bytes":1837,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8f93c57db760a2b7","ae9eced0b12cbd2a","25c37fe51095276d","669ee474b9646a38"]}